                                                "sense_id": "5a5c0776-a359-3e45-8530-46b29f05f6ce",
                                                "text": "Before I simply create a root meaning X, is there any way I can use Ithkuil morphological categories or the 150 or so suffix categories to derive this word from a more general or primary word?"
